  <link:footnoteLink xlink:type="extended" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/link">
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH9C5FE48ABA1933CC40032B27B485FCEB" xlink:label="HH9C5FE48ABA1933CC40032B27B485FCEB" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH4E72247C262C0297441B825834446E15" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <div>
          <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%">Revenues earned from PJM Interconnection, LLC (PJM) per the revenue requirement for the Transmission Expansion Project filed with FERC. The</span>
          <span style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%">2023</span>
          <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%">year-to-date revenue requirement formula rate includes the Point-to-Point revenue per FERC Docket No.</span>
          <span style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%">ER07-562</span>
          <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%">. The annual requirement is allocated to a monthly revenue, paid to TrAIL by PJM members.</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span>
            <br />
          </span>
        </div>
        <div>
