                <p class="MsoNormal">
                  <span style="color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;">Pursuant to order at Docket No. ES25-17-000&#160; dated 1/24/2025, Trans-Allegheny Interstate Line Company received authorization to issue long-term debt in the amount of $650,000,000. To date $600,000,000 has been issued, with authorization to issue additional long-term debt in the amount of $50,000,000 remaining. Authorization expires on 1/23/2027.</span>
                </p>
              </td>
